// BESSER's many (besser/instances/many.py) in the Exam DSL: 1-path in three batches, no weights.
// 6-many.exam solved by QAOA instead: keep the two files' problems identical.
// Four exams whose conflicts form a path. Feasible: cost 0.
problem many_qaoa batches 3
students Ana Rui Eva
exam Algebra   { Ana }
exam Calculus  { Ana Rui }
exam Physics   { Rui Eva }
exam Chemistry { Eva }

solver { method QAOA depth 2 optimizer COBYLA iterations 150 shots 4096 seed 7 }
